{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はロケがありましたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして明日はじょしらく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くくるちゃんに気持ちを切り替えます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/23/6547612/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"25日、生ドルやります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストさんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドリング!!!さんと\nアフィリア・サーガさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"再び出演してくださって\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/23/6547612/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今回は\nさゆりんが残念ながら別仕事でMCができない(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで\n代わりにかわたんが一緒にMCしてくれます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか\n全く違った生ドルになりそうな予感ですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/23/6547612/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/23/6547612/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先月の生ドル後のドワンゴさんのインタビュー\nあがってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://news.dwango.jp/index.php?itemid=22450"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/23/6547612/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知遅くなってしまったのですが\n19日に発売された\n『OVERTURE』に\n載ってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綾小路翔さんと乃木團で\n対談させていただきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなお話が聞けたし\nこの対談本当にやらせたいただけて\n良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/23/6547612/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだのかたは\n是非チェックしてください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/23/6547612/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとつ前のブログの写メ\n真夏はチームら じゃないね(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏と撮った記憶無かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てへぺろぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってのは嘘だけど\nいつもブルーライト軽減のアプリ使ってるから\n写メあんまりちゃんとよく見てないの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、言い訳ですね( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、潔くいきます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パッと見\nまりちゃに見えました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/06/23/6547612/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}